	(text_box "EN resistors (Datasheet p.11):\nV_{START}: 7 V\nV_{STOP}: 6 V\nV_{EN}: 1.25 V\n\nR_{U} = (V_{START} - V_{STOP}) / 3 µA ~= 33.3k\nR_{D} = V_{EN} / (((V_{STOP} - V_{EN}) / R_{U}) +  4 µA) ~= 8.52k\n\n\nSlow start (Datasheet p.11):\r\nV_{REF}: 0.8 V\r\nI_{SS}: 2 µA\n\nC_{SS} = (T_{SS} * I_{SS}) / V_{REF}\nT_{SS}: 5 ms =>\nC_{SS} = 12.5 n"
